    "sentence_translations": [
      "Peach Blossoms",
      "",
      "Little Wu had to go home. A child gave him some peach blossoms, and he liked them very much.",
      "",
      "The old man said to him, ..",
      ".. “Everyone likes you very much. I hope you come to the Peach Colony again. I invite you to dinner!”",
      "",
      "Little Wu thanked the old man and said goodbye.",
      "",
      "The peach trees below the mountain were still blooming, and the pathway under the peach trees was still there.",
      "He walked along the pathway for a long time and arrived on the outside.",
      "",
      "It was raining on the outside, and he went home.",
      "",
      "When he got home, he called Mi Lai, ..",
      ".. “Mi Lai, I know a place that is very beautiful, where no one gets sick.",
      "There is hope there, and your child can be happy there! That place is called the Peach Colony.”",
      "",
      "Mi Lai didn’t say anything.",
      "After a long while, she said, “Little Wu, thank you! But my child is no longer with us. He can’t go there anymore.”"
    ]
  }
